<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-EDBERG HEADS SWEDISH DAVIS CUP TEAM AGAINST CZECHS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-EDBERG HEADS SWEDISH DAVIS CUP TEAM AGAINST CZECHS.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stefan Edberg, who made his final grand slam appearance at the U.S. Open, heads the Swedish Davis Cup team to play the Czech Republic in Prague from September 20-22.</p>
<p>Edberg will be joined by Thomas Enqvist, Jonas Bjorkman and Nicklas Kulti.</p>
